  "title": "Model-based aversive learning in humans is supported by preferential task state reactivation",
  "description": "This derivative dataset contains processed MEG data from a study investigating the neural mechanisms of model-based aversive learning in humans. The research examines how task state representations are preferentially reactivated during aversive learning, providing insights into the computational and neural basis of threat-related decision-making and learning processes.",
